#. type: Content of: <h2>
#: ../../landscapes/garching/description.en.utf8:1
msgid "Garching"
msgstr "Garching"

#. type: Content of: <p>
#: ../../landscapes/garching/description.en.utf8:2
msgid "A view from the ESO headquarters in Garching bei Munchen, Germany."
msgstr "Uma vista da sede do ESO em Garching bei München, Alemanha."

#. type: Content of: <h2>
#: ../../landscapes/geneva/description.en.utf8:1
msgid "Geneva"
msgstr "Genebra"

#. type: Content of: <p>
#: ../../landscapes/geneva/description.en.utf8:2
msgid ""
"Horizon line of Geneva. Sample to show compatibility with the format used by"
" <a href=\"http://www.ap-i.net/skychart/en/start\">Cartes du Ciel</a>, taken"
" with permission from <a "
"href=\"http://sourceforge.net/p/skychart/code/HEAD/tree/trunk/tools/data/horizon/horizon_Geneve.txt\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Linha do horizonte de Genebra. Amostra para demonstrar a compatibilidade com"
" o formato usado pelo <a "
"href=\"http://www.ap-i.net/skychart/en/start\">Cartes du Ciel</a>, obtida "
"com permissão <a "
"href=\"http://sourceforge.net/p/skychart/code/HEAD/tree/trunk/tools/data/horizon/horizon_Geneve.txt\">daqui</a>."

#. type: Content of: <h2>
#: ../../landscapes/grossmugl/description.en.utf8:1
msgid "Grossmugl"
msgstr "Grossmugl"

#. type: Content of: <p>
#: ../../landscapes/grossmugl/description.en.utf8:2
msgid ""
"Field next to the Leeberg (Hallstatt-era giant tumulus, 16m) at Grossmugl, "
"Lower Austria, primary observing Spot of the Grossmugl Starlight Oasis near "
"Vienna."
msgstr ""
"Campo próximo ao Leeberg (túmulo gigante da era de Hallstatt, 16 m) em "
"Grossmugl, Baixa Áustria, principal local de observação do Grossmugl "
"Starlight Oasis, perto de Viena."

#. type: Content of: <p>
#: ../../landscapes/grossmugl/description.en.utf8:3
msgid ""
"Despite its vicinity to a large city, light pollution is concentrated mostly"
" on the southern horizon, and the Milky Way is well visible if a bit higher "
"in the sky.  In the eastern horizon, red lights indicate a wind park also at"
" night.  <a "
"href=\"https://starlightoasis.org\">https://starlightoasis.org</a>."
msgstr ""
"Apesar da proximidade de uma grande cidade, a poluição luminosa está "
"concentrada principalmente no horizonte sul e a Via Láctea é bem visível, "
"embora esteja um pouco mais alta no céu. No horizonte leste, luzes vermelhas"
" indicam um parque eólico que também funciona à noite. <a "
"href=\"https://starlightoasis.org\">https://starlightoasis.org</a>."

#. type: Content of: <h2>
#: ../../landscapes/guereins/description.en.utf8:1
msgid "Guéreins"
msgstr "Guéreins"

#. type: Content of: <p>
#: ../../landscapes/guereins/description.en.utf8:2
msgid ""
"Guéreins is a small French village in the Valley of the Saône river, 50 km "
"North of Lyon. In the west stand the small mountains of the \"Beaujolais\" "
"where the famous wine is produced. It is also the town where Stellarium was "
"born :)"
msgstr ""
"Guéreins é uma pequena vila francesa no vale do rio Saône, 50 km ao norte de"
" Lyon. A oeste ficam as pequenas montanhas do “Beaujolais”, onde é produzido"
" o famoso vinho. É também a cidade onde o Stellarium nasceu :)"

#. type: Content of: <h2>
#: ../../landscapes/hurricane/description.en.utf8:1
msgid "Hurricane"
msgstr "Furacão"

#. type: Content of: <p>
#: ../../landscapes/hurricane/description.en.utf8:2
msgid ""
"An edited view from Hurricane Ridge in Olympic National Park, Washington. In"
" reality there is an expansive view of the rest of the Olympic range to the "
"South but lighting conditions were poor."
msgstr ""
"Uma vista editada a partir de Hurricane Ridge, no Parque Nacional Olympic, "
"Washington. Na realidade, há uma vista ampla do restante da cordilheira "
"Olympic ao sul, mas as condições de iluminação eram ruins."

