msgid "Jupiter"
msgstr "Júpiter"

#. type: Content of: <p>
#: ../../landscapes/jupiter/description.en.utf8:2
msgid "Simple Jupiter gas surface (\"top of atmosphere\")"
msgstr "Superfície gasosa simples de Júpiter (\"topo da atmosfera\")"

#. type: Content of: <h2>
#: ../../landscapes/mars/description.en.utf8:1
msgid "Mars"
msgstr "Marte"

#. type: Content of: <p>
#: ../../landscapes/mars/description.en.utf8:2
msgid ""
"The panoramic camera on NASA's Mars Exploration Rover Spirit took the "
"hundreds of images combined into this 360-degree view, the \"Husband Hill "
"Summit\" panorama. The images were acquired on Spirit's sols 583 to 586 "
"(Aug. 24 to 27, 2005), shortly after the rover reached the crest of "
"\"Husband Hill\" inside Mars' Gusev Crater."
msgstr ""
"A câmera panorâmica do rover Spirit, da missão Mars Exploration Rover da "
"NASA, captou as centenas de imagens combinadas nesta vista de 360 graus, o "
"panorama do “Husband Hill Summit”. As imagens foram obtidas nos sóis 583 a "
"586 do Spirit (24 a 27 de agosto de 2005), pouco depois de o rover alcançar "
"o cume do “Husband Hill”, dentro da cratera Gusev, em Marte."

